   "description": "Fetch a URL and get it back ready for an LLM or RAG pipeline: clean markdown (headings and links kept), plain text, the title, the page's links and fetch metadata. POST /v1/extract with {url} and optional formats and max_chars. JSON in, JSON out, errors included. Pay per request in USDC; no account, no API key.",
   "mimeType": "application/json",
   "serviceName": "Pocket Network",
   "tags": [
    "web",
    "agentsearch-web-extract-v1",
    "rest"
   ],
